  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T L.151 refers to the installation of optical fibre ground wire cable. It deals with the factors that should be considered in determining the characteristics of this type of cable, the apparatus that should be used, the precautions that should be taken in handling the reels, and the method that should be used to string the cable and joint it.</abstract>
